OL,3,GNEWSA'Fight still on' to tackle spread
OL,4,Aof Asian hornets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "fight is still on" to stop the
OL,7,Fspread of Asian hornets despite an
OL,8,Fincrease in nests, said Guernsey's
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FAsian hornets are an invasive species
OL,12,Fand an aggressive predator of many
OL,13,Ftypes of insect, especially honey bees.
OL,15,FAnnelotte Baas-Jehan, the States of
OL,16,FGuernsey's invasive non-native species
OL,17,Fpolicy and co-ordination officer, said
OL,18,Fit had been a "quite a busy season so
OL,19,Ffar" with an increase in queens and
OL,20,Fnests, but emphasised that the
OL,21,Fsituation was "still manageable".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
